{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_desktop_desktop", "label": "Doctrina de apps de escritorio (Electron / Tauri)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/DESKTOP.md", "source_location": "L1-L96", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_desktop_electron_vs_tauri", "label": "Electron vs Tauri", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/DESKTOP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Electron empaqueta Chromium+Node (~80-200 MB) y todo el runtime es JS; Tauri usa el WebView2 del sistema y compila un binario Rust (~3-10 MB) a cambio de exigir toolchain Rust+MSVC en la m\u00e1quina de build."}, {"id": "docs_desktop_node_abi_mismatch", "label": "Desajuste de ABI de Node en m\u00f3dulos nativos", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/DESKTOP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Un .node compilado para Node no sirve para Electron sin recompilar contra su ABI: `npx electron-rebuild` es el fix, y el registro autoritativo es electron/node-abi, no la memoria."}, {"id": "docs_desktop_windows_code_signing", "label": "Firma de c\u00f3digo en Windows", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/DESKTOP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Electron firma con CSC_LINK/CSC_KEY_PASSWORD y Tauri con certificateThumbprint en bundle.windows; sin certificado el instalador se genera igual \u2014 es un paso de distribuci\u00f3n pendiente, no un fallo de build."}, {"id": "docs_desktop_installer_verification", "label": "Verificaci\u00f3n del instalador", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/DESKTOP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Evidencia m\u00ednima: artefacto con tama\u00f1o plausible y LastWriteTime reciente; si la instalaci\u00f3n silenciosa no es viable de forma no interactiva, la verificaci\u00f3n queda como PARCIAL, no como \u00e9xito."}, {"id": "docs_desktop_rust_log_token_rule", "label": "Regla de tokens para logs de Rust/bundler", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/DESKTOP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Los logs de Rust y webpack/Vite van a un archivo; a la conversaci\u00f3n solo llegan las l\u00edneas del error real."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_desktop_desktop", "target": "docs_desktop_electron_vs_tauri", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/DESKTOP.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_desktop_desktop", "target": "docs_desktop_node_abi_mismatch", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/DESKTOP.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_desktop_desktop", "target": "docs_desktop_windows_code_signing", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/DESKTOP.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_desktop_desktop", "target": "docs_desktop_installer_verification", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/DESKTOP.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_desktop_desktop", "target": "docs_desktop_rust_log_token_rule", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/DESKTOP.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_desktop_windows_code_signing", "target": "docs_android_release_keystore", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "docs/DESKTOP.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {